    p=['Every company must hold its **AGM by 30 September** (for most companies) and then file its financial statements in **Form AOC-4 within 30 days** of the AGM and its annual return in **Form MGT-7 or MGT-7A within 60 days**. Where an auditor is appointed at the AGM, **ADT-1** is filed within 15 days.',
       'These filings apply even if the company had no business. Late filing attracts additional fees for each day of delay, and continued default can lead to disqualification of directors and strike-off of the company.'],
